=== A. locate (Rule 203(b)(1)) is not a completed borrow ===
  borrowed and documented: locate_ok=True
  arrangement and documented: locate_ok=True
  reasonable grounds and documented: locate_ok=True
  reasonable grounds but not documented: locate_ok=False
  nothing in place: locate_ok=False
a locate can be reasonable grounds that the shares can be borrowed by settlement; it is not already borrowing them
